d yields were little changed from Friday.\par \par \uc2 - By Sam Holmes, Dow Jones Newswires; +65-6415-4157; samuel.holmes@dowjones.com [ 26-04-10 0826GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100426e64q000su\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
