ngapore dollar at 1.3905 for now," the trader added.\par \par \uc2 Singapore government yields were a tad lower, with the market rangebound ahead of a seven-year Singapore government bond auction later this month.\par \par \uc2 -By David Roman, Dow Jones Newswires, 65 6415 4045, david.roman@dowjones.com [ 11-03-10 0657GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100311e63b000fo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
