 compliance levels, Kuwaiti oil minister Sheikh Ahmad Abdullah al-Sabah said. (published 2220 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par WSJ(9/9) INDONESIA CRACKS OPEN POWER SECTOR FOR INVESTORS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 JAKARTA, Indonesia -- Indonesia's parliament moved to open the state-dominated power sector to more private investment, a potential step toward resolving electricity shortages that have hindered economic growth in the country of 240 million people. (published 0019 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par RENEWED ENERGY: OBAMA'S AGENDA BOOSTS LOBBYING \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Obama administration's focus on renewable energy and energy efficiency has spurred a burst of lobbying, as an emerging class of energy companies races to win federal funding and shape legislation. (published 2010 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par THAI FIN MIN: STRONG BAHT DUE TO TRADE SURPLUS, CAP INFLOWS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The recent strengthening of the Thai baht is mainly due to a continued trade surplus and capital inflows, Finance Minister Korn Chatikavanij said Wednesday. (published 0258 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =UPDATE: NATL AUSTRALIA BK TO LAUNCH 5-YEAR A$ BOND - SOURCES \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 National Australia Bank Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . plans to launch and price a benchmark five-year Australian-dollar denominated bond Wednesday, market participants said. (published 0058 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par TOP HEADLINES - Indian Media \par India Refiners Under-Recovery Loss This FY May Be INR250B - Business Standard \par Global Slowdown Hits Essar, Welspun SEZ Plans - Business Standard \par India Govt Refers Daimler Bid For Hero JV Stake To CCEA - PTI \par India Govt:States Can Only Levy Ctrl Sales Tax On Crude - The Hindu \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Jet Airways\f28 \uc2 \f2  India Sacks Further 2 Pilots - PTI \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Essar Oil\f28 \uc2 \f2  To Submit Coal-Gas Devt Plan To Govt Soon - DNA Money \par Lanco Infra To Up Kondapalli Plant Capacity