the bond market, the yield on the two-year paper was unchanged from Thursday's close, while that on the 10-year paper fell three basis points.\par \par \uc2 A trader said yields - which took their cues from U.S. Treasurys' performance overnight - could fall further if the domestic stock market declines.\par \par \uc2 -By Patricia Kowsmann, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4157; patricia.kowsmann@dowjones.com [ 14-08-09 0740GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020090814e58e000bo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
