\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore Dlr Up Late On Overnight Gains In Euro; Bonds Mixed\b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 2009\par 10:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                          Latest   Change \par    USD/SGD               1.4328   -0.0018 \par    Overnight rate        0.38%    Unchanged \par    Two-year bond yield:  0.42%    -1 bp \par    10-year bond yield:   2.55%    +4 bps \par    Two-year swap offer:  1.83%    +3 bps \par    10-year swap offer:   3.12%    +5 bps \par    2-10-yr swap curve:  129 bps   +2 bps \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar was higher in late Asian trade Thursday against the U.S. dollar, tracking gains in the euro overnight.\f28 \par \par \uc2 Traders said that the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will continue to trade in a range in the coming sessions, as it looks for fresh cues on the global economy.\par \par \uc2 "With some Asian markets, including Singapore, in positive territory, there was some build-up in risk appetite," said a trader with a local bank.\par \par \uc2 But the market mood still remained cautious, partly also on worries that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the U.S. dollar falls sharply.\par \par \uc2 Another trader with a foreign bank said that the market will now look at the U.S. non-farm payroll data due Friday.\par \par \uc2 "It (the payroll report) will be another good indicator on how the U.S. economy is doing, given the optimism of a recovery in the global economy," said the trader.\par \par \uc2 In the local bond market, prices were mixed, with some demand for short-dated securities.\par \par \uc2 "We could see some selling on the long-end curve post-lunch as the equity market is starting to look brighter," said another trader with a local bank.\par \par \uc2 -By P.R. Venkat, Dow Jones Newswires; +65 64154 152; venkat.pr@dowjones.com [ 06-08-09 0804GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020090806e586000nj\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Singapore near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brd